# Wave W17-P (Route 116): echo pine — a hill pine in deep quiet greens, its ranks thickening toward the tunnel hill, tiered and full with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on echo turf (ground baked in). Route 116’s own tree — deeper and stiller than Route 119’s wet drip-crowned rain pine: this pine listens, that one drips.
